# Line endings are not cosmetic here.
#
# qwen/entrypoint.sh is COPYed into a Linux image and run as its ENTRYPOINT. A
# CRLF checkout on Windows turns the shebang into `/usr/bin/env bash\r`, and the
# container dies with "no such file or directory" naming a file that plainly
# exists -- one of the least helpful errors in the business. The deploy scripts
# have the same problem when run under Git Bash.
*.sh            text eol=lf
Dockerfile      text eol=lf
Dockerfile.*    text eol=lf
*.py            text eol=lf
*.yaml          text eol=lf
*.yml           text eol=lf

# Reference voice clips. Never touch these.
*.wav           binary
